# Everything here would be copied into the build context and then thrown away.
# bin/ and obj/ are the expensive ones: they hold the host's build output, they
# are large, and copying them in lets a stale artefact from a developer's
# machine end up in the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
README.md
